{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國SM事務所的創辦人李秀滿於2023年2月因經營權競爭失利而離開SM，同月他將持有的14.8%股份出售予HYBE事務所，並簽訂為期3年的競業禁止協議，而他成立的A2O娛樂於上月13日在韓國推出新人女團A2O Lite及新人男團A2O SO</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T08:44:50.675939+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T08:25:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T08:37:56.333497+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T08:37:56.333497+00:00","content_hash":"a625b259c3cf66c6b7ca36ec63c5a9df4a8511f600f5583befdf3090cca8c4a5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}